  <Document>
    <name>Copy of Bahrain Off Limits Areas 17Oct2023</name>
    <description><![CDATA[It is prohibited to travel through areas in Bahrain that are defined as "off-limits areas". Red areas are Off-Limits and yellow are under Night Restriction. The Night Restriction is in effect between 1900 and 0500. Off Limits areas and demonstration notices provided by US Embassy and NSA Bahrain. ]]></description>
